# ============================================================
# BLUEGRID LAND SOLUTIONS
#
# This is a no-build static site, so there are no dependency or
# artifact directories to exclude. Everything below is deliberate.
# ============================================================

# ── Google Business Profile marketing assets ──
#
# Graphics produced for the GBP listing — service tiles, post
# images, cover art. They are marketing collateral, not website
# assets: nothing in index.html, the service pages, the location
# pages, or the stylesheets references them, and they are often
# large exports that would bloat the repository for no benefit.
#
# Kept locally so the owner has them to hand; not uploaded.

graphics/GBP - Services/
